OL,3,GNEWSA'I love African culture': Sir Mark
OL,4,ARylance stars in Tartuffe (Remixed)
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcademy Award winner Sir Mark Rylance
OL,7,Fis starring in a "remixed" version of a
OL,8,F17th Century play by Moliere at the
OL,9,FMarylebone Theatre.
OL,11,FTartuffe (Remixed) is set in London
OL,12,Fwith an African family about to marry
OL,13,Finto a Jamaican family and has been
OL,14,Fwritten and directed by Darren Raymond,
OL,15,Fwith whom Sir Mark has a long working
OL,16,Fhistory.
OL,18,FSir Mark plays the hilariously cunning
OL,19,FPastor Terrence Blake.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
