OL,3,GNEWSA'I love African culture': Sir Mark
OL,4,ARylance stars in Tartuffe (Remixed)
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He's the catalyst of the play. The
OL,7,Fplay is really about the family, but
OL,8,Fhe's a conman who comes in like any
OL,9,Fgood conman in a very convincing
OL,10,Fdisguise, in this case as an Anglican
OL,11,Fpriest," said Rylance.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
